{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":1613967,"duration_api_ms":1612851,"ttft_ms":2221,"time_to_request_ms":26,"num_turns":16,"result":"The implementation is complete. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n**Implemented in `src/vcd.rs`:**\n\n1. **`VCD::read_from_path`** — Opens the file and dispatches characters to `parse_instruction` (`$`), `parse_timestamp` (`#`), or `parse_assignment` (expression chars), skipping whitespace.\n\n2. **`VCD::get_signal_by_name`** — Iterates signals, comparing the null-terminated name against the input.\n\n3. **`Signal::get_value_at_timestamp`** — Walks value changes, returning the last change with `change.timestamp <= timestamp` (matches the C behavior including the early break on `<`).\n\n4. **`parse_instruction`** — Handles `end`/`dumpvars`/`dumpall` (no-ops), `scope` (state transitions + skip to `$`), `upscope`/`enddefinitions`/`comment`, `var` (skips inner-module vars; otherwise parses size/id/name and pushes a Signal), `date`/`version`/`timescale` (read until `$` or newline).\n\n5. **`parse_timestamp`** — Parses an unsigned 32-bit integer.\n\n6. **`parse_assignment`** — Reads to newline, distinguishes vector (`b...`) vs scalar values, and stores the value change at the index derived from the signal id.\n\n7. **`get_signal_index`** — Returns `c - '!'` if in `[0, VCD_SIGNAL_COUNT)`, else `None`.\n\n**Helpers:** Pure-Rust byte-level scanning helpers (`read_byte`/`unread_byte`/`skip_whitespace`/`read_while`/`read_word`/`read_usize`/`read_u32`) operate on `&File` via short-lived mutable `&File` handles, so no `unsafe`, no `libc`, and no FFI is used.\n\nThe build succeeds (with only a pre-existing warning about `State`'s privacy visibility, which can't be fixed without modifying the existing function signature). A smoke test against `c_src/test/assets/ram.vcd` correctly parses date, version, timescale, all 7 signals, and resolves `address @ timestamp 15` to `b100`, matching the expected behavior.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"b2061601-161c-40e0-8e2b-c4aae473807f","total_cost_usd":2.34784275,"usage":{"input_tokens":19,"cache_creation_input_tokens":30377,"cache_read_input_tokens":307116,"output_tokens":51410,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":30377},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"global.anthropic.claude-opus-4-7[1m]":{"inputTokens":20,"outputTokens":77658,"cacheReadInputTokens":321973,"cacheCreationInputTokens":39249,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.34784275,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"98736a82-91ce-4f71-8b1b-5ff21678356a"}
